00:14:06,387 --> 00:14:08,180
‎Traydor ka!

211
00:14:13,644 --> 00:14:16,312
‎-Hindi siya makakagalaw pansamantala.
‎-Matandang gurang.

212
00:14:16,313 --> 00:14:19,732
‎Isang bundok, bundok na puno ng kayamanan!

213
00:14:19,733 --> 00:14:21,776
‎Dali, bago mahuli ang lahat.

214
00:14:21,777 --> 00:14:23,319
‎Teka, matandang gurang.

215
00:14:23,320 --> 00:14:25,072
‎Ito ba talaga ang plano mo simula pa lang?

216
00:14:27,366 --> 00:14:30,786
‎Magkasabwat pala kayo ni Lolo, Ranma.

217
00:14:39,378 --> 00:14:41,170
‎Makinig ka, Ranma.

218
00:14:41,171 --> 00:14:43,715
‎Magtulungan tayo
‎para makuha ang mga kayamanan.

219
00:14:43,716 --> 00:14:46,176
‎Wag mo akong itulad sa 'yo!

220
00:14:49,263 --> 00:14:52,516
‎Ranma. Umatake ka kahit saan mo gusto.

221
00:14:53,976 --> 00:14:56,060
‎Humanda ka, Akane.

222
00:14:56,061 --> 00:14:58,563
‎Gagawin ko ang lahat

223
00:14:58,564 --> 00:15:01,482
‎para makapasok
‎sa locker room ng mga babae!

224
00:15:01,483 --> 00:15:05,236
‎Bravo, Ranma. Gagawin mo talaga 'yon
‎para lang sa panty—

225
00:15:05,237 --> 00:15:07,196
‎Para sa Bukal ng Nalunod na Lalaki.

226
00:15:07,197 --> 00:15:09,157
‎Di bale na.

227
00:15:09,158 --> 00:15:11,493
‎Kung makikipaglaban ka sa mga babae...

228
00:15:12,036 --> 00:15:13,912
‎Ayos. Nakakadiri ka.

229
00:15:13,913 --> 00:15:14,955
‎Ribbit.

230
00:15:16,290 --> 00:15:17,875
‎Walang tatalo sa ganitong paraan!

231
00:15:20,419 --> 00:15:23,671
‎Kumalma kayo, girls. Mga laruan lang 'to.

232
00:15:23,672 --> 00:15:27,300
‎Hindi! Ahas 'to! At mga palaka!

233
00:15:27,301 --> 00:15:30,094
‎Totoo 'to, hindi 'to laruan!

234
00:15:30,095 --> 00:15:31,388
‎Ranma!

235
00:15:33,307 --> 00:15:34,350
‎Ribbit.

236
00:15:36,435 --> 00:15:37,895
‎Ribbit, ribbit!

237
00:15:40,397 --> 00:15:41,565
‎Ranma.

238
00:15:48,447 --> 00:15:49,657
‎Magnanakaw!

239
00:15:58,040 --> 00:16:00,875
<i>‎Buwisit. Nahalata niya bang
‎nag-ibang anyo ako?</i>

240
00:16:00,876 --> 00:16:03,503
<i>‎Akala ko hindi ako mabibisto.</i>

241
00:16:03,504 --> 00:16:05,004
‎Pasensiya ka na!

242
00:16:05,005 --> 00:16:06,799
‎Akala ko ikaw si Ranma.

243
00:16:07,716 --> 00:16:10,009
‎Napakasama mo.

244
00:16:10,010 --> 00:16:12,262
‎Wala akong ginawa.

245
00:16:13,222 --> 00:16:14,555
‎Pasensiya ka na!

246
00:16:14,556 --> 00:16:16,100
‎Pasensiya na talaga!

247
00:16:17,601 --> 00:16:18,602
‎Pero...

248
00:16:23,107 --> 00:16:24,315
‎gusto kita.

249
00:16:24,316 --> 00:16:26,150
‎Ano? Ha? Sandali.

250
00:16:26,151 --> 00:16:28,528
‎Ngayon lang tayo nagkakilala, paano ka...

251
00:16:28,529 --> 00:16:31,447
‎Galit ka ba sa mga babaeng nakasalamin?

252
00:16:31,448 --> 00:16:33,658
‎Hindi... pero...

253
00:16:33,659 --> 00:16:35,660
‎may gusto akong iba...

254
00:16:35,661 --> 00:16:37,203
‎Ayos lang sa 'kin.

255
00:16:37,204 --> 00:16:38,496
‎Pero...

256
00:16:38,497 --> 00:16:39,665
‎Talaga?

257
00:16:40,958 --> 00:16:42,375
‎Lagot ka sa 'kin!

258
00:16:42,376 --> 00:16:44,877
‎Ano'ng ginagawa mo?

259
00:16:44,878 --> 00:16:48,214
‎Akane. Mali ka ng iniisip.

260
00:16:48,215 --> 00:16:49,841
‎Wala akong ginawa—

261
00:16:49,842 --> 00:16:52,760
{\an8}‎Hoy, Akane! Bakit ba lagi kang
‎humahadlang sa 'kin?

262
00:16:52,761 --> 00:16:57,306
‎Ranma. Magpapakababa ka
‎para lang makakuha ng panty?

263
00:16:57,307 --> 00:17:00,685
{\an8}‎Tanga. Wala akong pakialam sa panty.

264
00:17:00,686 --> 00:17:01,937
{\an8}‎Gusto mo, di ba?

265
00:17:02,730 --> 00:17:04,523
‎Ibibigay ko sa 'yo lahat.

266
00:17:05,566 --> 00:17:09,277
‎'Yan naman
‎'yong ginamit naming patibong, e.

267
00:17:09,278 --> 00:17:10,737
‎Makinig ka sa 'kin...

268
00:17:10,738 --> 00:17:13,741
‎Kaya, pakiusap.

269
00:17:14,450 --> 00:17:16,452
‎Tumigil ka na sa paglabag ng batas.

270
00:17:17,202 --> 00:17:20,372
‎Hindi ko akalaing magagawa mo 'to.

271
00:17:20,956 --> 00:17:22,040
‎Paalam!

272
00:17:22,041 --> 00:17:26,378
‎Sandali! Pumunta ako rito para hukayin
‎ang Bukal ng Nalunod na Lalaki.

273
00:17:27,671 --> 00:17:29,048
‎Bukal ng Nalunod na Lalaki?

274
00:17:30,090 --> 00:17:33,510
‎Nasa ilalim ng locker room ng mga babae?

275
00:17:34,261 --> 00:17:36,429
‎'Yon ba ang dahilan, Ranma?

276
00:17:36,430 --> 00:17:38,514
‎Mukha bang nagsisinungaling
‎ang mga mata ko?

277
00:17:38,515 --> 00:17:41,852
‎Gawin mo namang kapani-paniwala
‎ang pagsisinungaling mo.

278
00:17:42,561 --> 00:17:46,065
‎Ang galing mong magpanggap kanina, Ranma.

279
00:17:47,441 --> 00:17:48,608
‎Tama.

280
00:17:48,609 --> 00:17:52,029
‎Wala pa akong nakaka-date na babae
‎sa buong buhay ko.

281
00:17:53,822 --> 00:17:56,824
‎At lalo pang walang nagtatapat sa 'kin.

282
00:17:56,825 --> 00:18:00,620
‎Kahit minsan sa buong buhay ko...

283
00:18:00,621 --> 00:18:02,288
‎Narinig mo ba 'yon?

284
00:18:02,289 --> 00:18:03,540
‎Kawawa naman siya.

285
00:18:05,292 --> 00:18:06,502
‎Ano naman?

286
00:18:07,628 --> 00:18:10,546
‎Magpakatotoo ka
‎at sabihin mo sa 'kin, Ranma.

287
00:18:10,547 --> 00:18:14,175
‎Bakit ka gumawa ng gano'ng kalokohan?

288
00:18:14,176 --> 00:18:17,303
‎Malamang,
‎para sa Bukal ng Nalunod na Lalaki—

289
00:18:17,304 --> 00:18:19,139
‎Sinasabi mo bang...

290
00:18:21,475 --> 00:18:23,684
‎kaya paulit-ulit mong tinapakan

291
00:18:23,685 --> 00:18:27,897
‎ang inosenteng lalaki?

292
00:18:27,898 --> 00:18:29,398
‎Tumahimik ka.

293
00:18:29,399 --> 00:18:32,235
‎Ikaw ang nagpakita sa 'kin

294
00:18:32,236 --> 00:18:34,488
‎ng mapa papunta
‎sa Bukal ng Nalunod na Lalaki!

295
00:18:38,492 --> 00:18:41,078
‎Ryoga, totoo ba 'yon?

296
00:18:41,578 --> 00:18:44,748
‎Bakit ka may mapa
‎ng Bukal ng Nalunod na Lalaki?

297
00:18:48,502 --> 00:18:50,921
‎Ryoga, wag mong sabihing...

298
00:19:09,064 --> 00:19:10,816
<i>‎Alam na nila ang sekreto ko.</i>

299
00:19:11,483 --> 00:19:13,819
‎Gusto mong tanggalin ang sumpa ni Ranma.

300
00:19:14,653 --> 00:19:16,405
‎Napakabait mong lalaki.

301
00:19:17,322 --> 00:19:20,325
‎Mabuti na lang at mabagal makaintindi
‎si Akane, 'no, P-chan?

302
00:19:26,248 --> 00:19:27,291
‎Sino'ng...

303
00:19:28,000 --> 00:19:30,627
‎tinatawag mong P-chan?

304
00:19:32,671 --> 00:19:34,463
‎Ang...

305
00:19:34,464 --> 00:19:37,008
‎Mali ka ng tinatarget.

306
00:19:37,009 --> 00:19:39,887
‎...Hangganan!

307
00:19:55,694 --> 00:19:58,113
‎Ang pakiramdam na 'to ay...

308
00:20:03,577 --> 00:20:05,162
‎Nagawa natin.

309
00:20:16,757 --> 00:20:18,133
<i>‎Ang Bukal ng Nalunod na Lalaki.</i>

310
00:20:19,051 --> 00:20:20,844
<i>‎Nandito nga.</i>

311
00:20:22,512 --> 00:20:23,639
‎Hoy.

312
00:20:24,640 --> 00:20:28,685
‎Totoo 'yong mapa
‎ng Bukal ng Nalunod na Lalaki, di ba?

313
00:20:30,270 --> 00:20:32,980
‎E, bakit hindi ako bumabalik
‎sa pagiging lalaki?

314
00:20:32,981 --> 00:20:35,150
‎Magsalita ka, baboy!

315
00:20:43,075 --> 00:20:45,534
<i>‎Sarado na ang Bukal ng Nalunod na Lalaki</i>

316
00:20:45,535 --> 00:20:48,955
<i>‎na matagal n'yo nang tinatangkilik.</i>

317
00:20:48,956 --> 00:20:51,499
<i>‎Maaari n'yong bisitahin ang orihinal
‎na Bukal ng Nalunod na Lalaki</i>

318
00:20:51,500 --> 00:20:54,127
<i>‎sa Jusenkyo, China
‎para sa inyong pangangailangan.</i>

319
00:20:55,337 --> 00:20:58,298
‎Normal na paliguan lang pala 'yon?

320
00:20:58,882 --> 00:21:02,760
‎Hoy! Sino'ng may gawa nito?
‎Sino'ng sumira sa tubo ng tubig?

321
00:21:02,761 --> 00:21:04,263
‎Si Ranma.

322
00:21:08,600 --> 00:21:10,851
‎Saan mo nakuha ang panty na 'yan?

323
00:21:10,852 --> 00:21:12,187
‎Napulot ko.

324
00:21:15,482 --> 00:21:19,068
‎Ano'ng problema, P-chan?
‎Parang wala kang gana.

325
00:21:19,069 --> 00:21:23,115
‎Mukhang mas magiging masaya ka
‎sa ganiyang anyo.

326
00:22:57,042 --> 00:23:02,047
{\an8}‎Nagsalin ng Subtitle: Kristine Gutierrez

